{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>But a man of contributions</b> — We know that the contributions of the nasi, which he takes from the people of the land, is a sixth of an ephah. That is: a king — through justice that he does — establishes the land, but a man who takes contributions more than the known measure destroys it."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:19.459288054Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}